Zot registry (replaces distribution registry:2)

Ports:
  https://localhost:3244/     API + UI

Data:
  data      -> legacy distribution storage (kept as backup after migrate)
  data-zot  -> Zot OCI storage (live)

Commands:
  make run / make run-zot   start Zot
  make migrate-zot          sync from legacy :3245 into Zot
  make migrate-status       compare catalog counts
  make migrate-finish       drop sync, stop legacy, serve production config
